lays any role\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Social media contributes to the problem but not exclusively\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"Which word best describes the author's tone towards misinformation online?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Optimistic\",\n        \"Neutral\",\n        \"Critical\",\n        \"Impassioned\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Critical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author most concerned about in relation to misinformation?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The spread of false information\",\n        \"The impact on social media platforms\",\n        \"The economic consequences for news organizations\",\n        \"The increased usage of fake news sites\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"The spread of false information\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
